# OpenEUICC (privileged eSIM LPA, im.angry.openeuicc) is a platform-signed priv-app
# and runs in the platform_app domain. Under enforcing it was denied service_manager
# 'find' on the OMAPI SecureElement service, so the LPA spun forever ("loading").
# Grant platform_app access to the OMAPI SecureElement service so OpenEUICC can
# enumerate SE readers / reach the eUICC.
allow platform_app secure_element_service:service_manager find;
